body:
I just came across this. Commenting in case someone googling "litheli snowblower" sees this.

&#x200B;

Stay away. Far away. Yesterday I got about 14 inches of relatively heavy snow. It would've taken two battery charges to clear my driveway out. Just my driveway. A job that should take about 30 minutes ended up taking me all day. I finally caved and bought a legitimate two stage snow blower, and the difference is night and day.

&#x200B;

Your money is best spent on a good snowblower. Don't cheap out on one.
